       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           I D E N T I F I C A T I O N   D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM NAME
      ******************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. SWB4010.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                      - MENSAGENS SWIFT -                       *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * Migração de movimentos de contas de correspondentes            *
      ******************************************************************
      *           L O G     D E     A L T E R A C O E S                *
      ******************************************************************
      *  INICIO  * AUTOR  * FIM    *  C O M E N T A R I O S            *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           E N V I R O N M E N T         D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                      INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                   D A T A   D I V I S I O N                    *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                          FILE SECTION                          *
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                     *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER              PIC X(40) VALUE 'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE'.
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWB4010'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * TABELAS
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204  END-EXEC.
      *
       01  DCLSWPARAM.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF SWPARAM  PREFIX BY 'SWPARAM-'.
       01  DCLGBMVCO.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF GBMVCO   PREFIX BY 'GBMVCO-'.
       01  DCLNCCCBCOR.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF NCCCBCOR PREFIX BY 'NCCCBCOR-'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * CONSTANTES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWPARAM                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWPARAM'.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-GBMVCO                   PIC  X(10) VALUE 'GBMVCO'.
           05 CON-NCCCBCOR                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'NCCCBCOR'.
           05 CON-PRDESC                   PIC  X(40) VALUE
                                                'Conta Correspondente'.
           05 CON-BOOLEAN                  PIC  X(01) VALUE 'B'.
           05 CON-DATA-MINIMA              PIC S9(08) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE 10101.
           05 CON-PD                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-P                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'P'.
           05 CON-O00                      PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.

      ******************************************************************
      * VARIAVEIS
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-PRPARAM               PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-PRPARAM.
              10 WS-NCCCCBAN           PIC  X(04).
              10 WS-NCCCCSPAI          PIC  X(02).
              10 WS-NCCCMOED           PIC  X(03).
              10 FILLER                PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-DATE-TODAY            PIC  9(08) VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-FIRST-DATE            PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-NEW-DATE              PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-PRVALDAT              PIC  9(08) VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-PRVALALF              PIC  X(35) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-PRVALALF.
              10 WS-CHRNOPR            PIC  X(09).
              10 WS-MRNOPR REDEFINES WS-CHRNOPR
                                       PIC  9(09).
              10 WS-CHRNORD            PIC  X(07).
              10 WS-MRNORD REDEFINES WS-CHRNORD
                                       PIC  9(07).
              10 FILLER                PIC  X(19).
           05 WS-PARAGRAPH-NAME        PIC  X(30) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-CODIGO                PIC  X(03) VALUE SPACES.

      ******************************************************************
      * SWITCHES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-SWITCHES.
           05 SW-NCCCBCOR-STATUS           PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE  0.
              88 SW-NCCCBCOR-OK                            VALUE  0.
              88 SW-NCCCBCOR-END                           VALUE -1.
      *
           05 SW-PARAM-STATUS              PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE  0.
              88 SW-PARAM-OK                               VALUE  0.
              88 SW-PARAM-NOTFND                           VALUE -1.
      *
           05 SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS           PIC  X(01)      VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-OK                            VALUE 'S'.
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK                         VALUE 'N'.
      *
           05 SW-GBMVCO-STATUS             PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE  0.
              88 SW-GBMVCO-OK                              VALUE  0.
              88 SW-GBMVCO-END                             VALUE -1.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * COPYS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY AQCL0001.
           COPY AQCK0001.
           COPY SWCK0002.
           COPY SWCK0003.
           COPY SWCL5000.
           COPY VIAW0050.
           COPY VIAW0030.
           COPY VIAL0015.
           COPY BRCL1020.
           COPY AQCW0109.
      *    COPY AQCW0009.
           COPY AQCW0011.
           COPY SXCL1000.
           COPY ETCL9221.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * DB2
      ******************************************************************
      *
           EXEC SQL
              DECLARE CRS_NCCCBCOR CURSOR WITH HOLD FOR
                SELECT NCCCBALC
                     , NCCCCCB
                     , NCCCMOED
                     , NCCCCBAN
                     , NCCCCSPAI
                     , NCCCCCONTA
                  FROM NCCCBCOR
                 WHERE NCCCCBAN   <> :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                   AND NCCCCSPAI  <> :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                   AND NCCCMOED   <> :NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
                 ORDER
                    BY NCCCBALC
                     , NCCCCCB
                  WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              DECLARE CRS_GBMVCO   CURSOR WITH HOLD FOR
                 SELECT MRBALC
                      , MRCCB
                      , MRBAL
                      , GBMRCONTA
                      , MRTDOC
                      , MRCOPE
                      , MRNDOC
                      , MRVLR
                      , MRSALD
                      , MRUSER
                      , MRDTSIS
                      , MRHORA
                      , MRDATL
                      , MRDRCX
                      , MRETRB
                      , MRBALM
                      , MROBS
                      , MRNOPR
                      , MRNOPS
                      , MRNCX
                      , MRNTCX
                      , MRNORD
                      , MRMINV
                      , MREANL
                      , MRDTCB
                      , MREXCT
                      , MRMOED
                      , MRDMOV
                      , MRTXA
                      , MRVLRI
                      , MRAUTR
                      , MRNTIT
                      , MRMVCC
                      , GBMRCONTAR
                      , MRGRPP
                      , GBMRMOVREC
                      , GBMRDATREC
                      , GBMRGRMOV
                      , GBMRINFC
                   FROM GBMVCO
                  WHERE MRBALC  =  :GBMVCO-MRBALC
                    AND MRCCB   =  :GBMVCO-MRCCB
                    AND MRMOED  =  :GBMVCO-MRMOED
                    AND MRDATL  >= :WS-FIRST-DATE
      *             AND (
      *                       MRNOPR  >  :GBMVCO-MRNOPR
      *                   OR  MRNOPR  =  :GBMVCO-MRNOPR
      *                   AND MRNORD  >  :GBMVCO-MRNORD
      *             )
                  ORDER
                     BY MRDATL
                      , MRNOPR
                      , MRNORD
                   WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40)
                                         VALUE 'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      ******************************************************************
      *                        LINKAGE SECTION                         *
      ******************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.
           COPY AQCW0009.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AQCW0009-DATA.

      ******************************************************************
      *              P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N               *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT
             UNTIL SW-NCCCBCOR-END
                OR NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS.
      *
           PERFORM 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           GOBACK.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE WS-VARIAVEIS         REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-OK
                SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK          TO TRUE.
      *
           PERFORM AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ
              THRU AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-INICIO
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-INICIO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE AQCW0100-AT-DTOP        TO WS-DATE-TODAY
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 4100-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR
                 THRU 4199-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 4200-LER-NCCCBCOR
              THRU 4299-LER-NCCCBCOR-EXIT
             UNTIL NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                OR SW-NCCCBCOR-END
                OR SW-PRVALBOL-OK.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 5100-ABRIR-GBMVCO
              THRU 5199-ABRIR-GBMVCO-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 5200-LER-GBMVCO
                 THRU 5299-LER-GBMVCO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 5300-TRATAR-GBMVCO
              THRU 5399-TRATAR-GBMVCO-EXIT
             UNTIL SW-GBMVCO-END
                OR NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS.
      *
           PERFORM 5400-FECHAR-GBMVCO
              THRU 5499-FECHAR-GBMVCO-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 7300-ACTUALIZA-PARAM
                 THRU 7399-ACTUALIZA-PARAM-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           SET  SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK          TO TRUE.
      *
           PERFORM 4200-LER-NCCCBCOR
              THRU 4299-LER-NCCCBCOR-EXIT
             UNTIL NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                OR SW-NCCCBCOR-END
                OR SW-PRVALBOL-OK.
      *
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '3000-FIM-PROGRAMA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE 'AQCW0009-RCODE'        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE AQCW0009-RCODE          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 4300-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR
              THRU 4399-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM AQCP0009-TRATA-RCODE
              THRU AQCP0009-TRATA-RCODE-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT
              THRU AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-FIM
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-FIM-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       3099-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       4100-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '4100-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SPACES                     TO NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                                              NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                                              NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED.
      *
           SET  SW-NCCCBCOR-OK             TO TRUE.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              OPEN CRS_NCCCBCOR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-NCCCBCOR              TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF NOT AQCW0011-OK
              SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                   VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR      TO TRUE
              MOVE WS-PROGNAME             TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
              MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID      TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME     TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE        TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
              MOVE 'Erro OPEN Cursor'      TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       4199-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       4200-LER-NCCCBCOR.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '4200-LER-NCCCBCOR'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              FETCH CRS_NCCCBCOR
               INTO :NCCCBCOR-NCCCBALC
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCB
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCONTA
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-NCCCBCOR               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 PERFORM 7100-OBTER-PARAM
                    THRU 7199-OBTER-PARAM-EXIT
      *
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET  SW-NCCCBCOR-END      TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                     VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR    TO TRUE
                MOVE WS-PROGNAME           TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID    TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME   TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE      TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'Erro FETCH Cursor'   TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       4299-LER-NCCCBCOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       4300-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '4200-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              CLOSE CRS_NCCCBCOR
           END-EXEC.
      *
       4399-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5100-ABRIR-GBMVCO.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5100-ABRIR-GBMVCO'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           SET  SW-GBMVCO-OK               TO TRUE.
      *
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCBALC          TO GBMVCO-MRBALC.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCB           TO GBMVCO-MRCCB.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED          TO GBMVCO-MRMOED.
      *
           IF WS-CHRNOPR NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE ZEROES                  TO WS-MRNOPR
           END-IF.
      *
           IF WS-CHRNORD NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE ZEROES                  TO WS-MRNORD
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE WS-MRNOPR                  TO GBMVCO-MRNOPR.
           MOVE WS-MRNORD                  TO GBMVCO-MRNORD.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              OPEN CRS_GBMVCO
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-GBMVCO                TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF NOT AQCW0011-OK
              SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                   VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR      TO TRUE
              MOVE WS-PROGNAME             TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
              MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID      TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME     TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE        TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
              MOVE 'Erro OPEN Cursor'      TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       5199-ABRIR-GBMVCO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5200-LER-GBMVCO.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5200-LER-GBMVCO'          TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              FETCH CRS_GBMVCO
               INTO :GBMVCO-MRBALC
                  , :GBMVCO-MRCCB
                  , :GBMVCO-MRBAL
                  , :GBMVCO-GBMRCONTA
                  , :GBMVCO-MRTDOC
                  , :GBMVCO-MRCOPE
                  , :GBMVCO-MRNDOC
                  , :GBMVCO-MRVLR
                  , :GBMVCO-MRSALD
                  , :GBMVCO-MRUSER
                  , :GBMVCO-MRDTSIS
                  , :GBMVCO-MRHORA
                  , :GBMVCO-MRDATL
                  , :GBMVCO-MRDRCX
                  , :GBMVCO-MRETRB
                  , :GBMVCO-MRBALM
                  , :GBMVCO-MROBS
                  , :GBMVCO-MRNOPR
                  , :GBMVCO-MRNOPS
                  , :GBMVCO-MRNCX
                  , :GBMVCO-MRNTCX
                  , :GBMVCO-MRNORD
                  , :GBMVCO-MRMINV
                  , :GBMVCO-MREANL
                  , :GBMVCO-MRDTCB
                  , :GBMVCO-MREXCT
                  , :GBMVCO-MRMOED
                  , :GBMVCO-MRDMOV
                  , :GBMVCO-MRTXA
                  , :GBMVCO-MRVLRI
                  , :GBMVCO-MRAUTR
                  , :GBMVCO-MRNTIT
                  , :GBMVCO-MRMVCC
                  , :GBMVCO-GBMRCONTAR
                  , :GBMVCO-MRGRPP
                  , :GBMVCO-GBMRMOVREC
                  , :GBMVCO-GBMRDATREC
                  , :GBMVCO-GBMRGRMOV
                  , :GBMVCO-GBMRINFC
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-GBMVCO                 TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET  SW-GBMVCO-END        TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                     VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR    TO TRUE
                MOVE WS-PROGNAME           TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID    TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME   TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE      TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'Erro FETCH Cursor'   TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       5299-LER-GBMVCO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5300-TRATAR-GBMVCO.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5300-TRATAR-GBMVCO'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 6100-PREPARAR-LINHA
              THRU 6199-PREPARAR-LINHA-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 6200-INSERIR-LINHA
                 THRU 6299-INSERIR-LINHA-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 5200-LER-GBMVCO
                 THRU 5299-LER-GBMVCO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       5399-TRATAR-GBMVCO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5400-FECHAR-GBMVCO.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5400-FECHAR-GBMVCO'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              CLOSE CRS_GBMVCO
           END-EXEC.
      *
       5499-FECHAR-GBMVCO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       6100-PREPARAR-LINHA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '6100-PREPARAR-LINHA'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE DCLSWCD7204          REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRBALC              TO SWCD7204-MRBALC.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRCCB               TO SWCD7204-MRCCB.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN          TO SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI         TO SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCONTA        TO SWCD7204-NCCCCCONTA.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRTDOC              TO SWCD7204-MRTDOC.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRCOPE              TO SWCD7204-MRCOPE.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRNDOC              TO SWCD7204-MRNDOC.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRVLR               TO SWCD7204-MRVLR.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRSALD              TO SWCD7204-MRSALD.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRUSER              TO SWCD7204-MRUSER.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRDTSIS             TO SWCD7204-MRDTSIS.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRHORA              TO SWCD7204-MRHORA.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRDATL              TO SWCD7204-MRDATL
                                              WS-NEW-DATE.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRDRCX              TO SWCD7204-MRDRCX.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRETRB              TO SWCD7204-MRETRB.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRBALM              TO SWCD7204-MRBALM.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MROBS               TO SWCD7204-MROBS.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRNOPR              TO SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                                              WS-MRNOPR.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRNOPS              TO SWCD7204-MRNOPS.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRNORD              TO SWCD7204-MRNORD
                                              WS-MRNORD.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MREANL              TO SWCD7204-MREANL.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRDTCB              TO SWCD7204-MRDTCB.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MREXCT              TO SWCD7204-MREXCT.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRMOED              TO SWCD7204-MRMOED.
           MOVE GBMVCO-MRDMOV              TO SWCD7204-MRDMOV.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CCHAVE.
           MOVE GBMVCO-GBMRINFC            TO SWCD7204-GBMRINFC.
      *    MOVE SWCK0002-NAO               TO SWCD7204-IRECONC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-IRECONC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CCODMSG.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD7204-DATVAL.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-COSN
                                              SWCD7204-COSNC
                                              SWCD7204-CREF
                                              SWCD7204-CREFOPR
                                              SWCD7204-GOBS.
           MOVE CON-P                      TO SWCD7204-CTIPREC.
           MOVE CON-PD                     TO SWCD7204-CCODEST.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.
           MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD7204-CNIVREC.
      *
       6199-PREPARAR-LINHA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       6200-INSERIR-LINHA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '6200-INSERIR-LINHA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              INSERT
                INTO SWVT7204 (
                     MRBALC
                   , MRCCB
                   , NCCCCBAN
                   , NCCCCSPAI
                   , NCCCCCONTA
                   , MRTDOC
                   , MRCOPE
                   , MRNDOC
                   , MRVLR
                   , MRSALD
                   , MRUSER
                   , MRDTSIS
                   , MRHORA
                   , MRDATL
                   , MRDRCX
                   , MRETRB
                   , MRBALM
                   , MROBS
                   , MRNOPR
                   , MRNOPS
                   , MRNORD
                   , MREANL
                   , MRDTCB
                   , MREXCT
                   , MRMOED
                   , MRDMOV
                   , GBMRINFC
                   , CCHAVE
                   , IRECONC
                   , CCODMSG
                   , DATVAL
                   , COSN
                   , COSNC
                   , CREF
                   , CREFOPR
                   , CTIPREC
                   , GOBS
                   , CCODEST
                   , IDRECONC
                   , CNATREC
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST
                   , CNIVREC
                )
              VALUES (
                     :SWCD7204-MRBALC
                   , :SWCD7204-MRCCB
                   , :SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN
                   , :SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI
                   , :SWCD7204-NCCCCCONTA
                   , :SWCD7204-MRTDOC
                   , :SWCD7204-MRCOPE
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNDOC
                   , :SWCD7204-MRVLR
                   , :SWCD7204-MRSALD
                   , :SWCD7204-MRUSER
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDTSIS
                   , :SWCD7204-MRHORA
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDATL
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDRCX
                   , :SWCD7204-MRETRB
                   , :SWCD7204-MRBALM
                   , :SWCD7204-MROBS
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNOPS
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNORD
                   , :SWCD7204-MREANL
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDTCB
                   , :SWCD7204-MREXCT
                   , :SWCD7204-MRMOED
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDMOV
                   , :SWCD7204-GBMRINFC
                   , :SWCD7204-CCHAVE
                   , :SWCD7204-IRECONC
                   , :SWCD7204-CCODMSG
                   , :SWCD7204-DATVAL
                   , :SWCD7204-COSN
                   , :SWCD7204-COSNC
                   , :SWCD7204-CREF
                   , :SWCD7204-CREFOPR
                   , :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                   , :SWCD7204-GOBS
                   , :SWCD7204-CCODEST
                   , :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                   , :SWCD7204-CNATREC
                   , :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                   , :SWCD7204-CNIVREC
                )
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
              WHEN DB2-DUPREC
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO AQCW0100-PGMNAME
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO AQCW0100-PARAGRAPH
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO AQCW0100-NM-ENTIDADE
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO AQCW0100-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro INSERT tabela' TO AQCW0100-DESC1
                 PERFORM AQCP0100-ESCREVE-MSG
                    THRU AQCP0100-ESCREVE-MSG-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       6299-INSERIR-LINHA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       7100-OBTER-PARAM.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '7100-OBTER-PARAM'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE DCLSWPARAM           REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN          TO WS-NCCCCBAN.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI         TO WS-NCCCCSPAI.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED          TO WS-NCCCMOED.
      *
           SET  SW-PARAM-OK                TO TRUE.
      *
           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC            TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE WS-PRPARAM                 TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT PRVALDAT
                   , PRVALBOL
                   , PRVALALF
                INTO :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALBOL
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALALF
                FROM SWPARAM
               WHERE PRCODPAR  =  :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                 AND PRPARAM   =  :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALBOL     TO SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS
                 MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALDAT     TO WS-FIRST-DATE
                 MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALALF     TO WS-PRVALALF
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET  SW-PARAM-NOTFND      TO TRUE
                 PERFORM 7200-CRIAR-PARAM
                    THRU 7299-CRIAR-PARAM-EXIT
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro SELECT'        TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       7199-OBTER-PARAM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       7200-CRIAR-PARAM.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '7200-CRIAR-PARAM'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE DCLSWPARAM           REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN          TO WS-NCCCCBAN.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI         TO WS-NCCCCSPAI.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED          TO WS-NCCCMOED.
      *
           MOVE CON-DATA-MINIMA            TO WS-FIRST-DATE.
      *
           SET  SW-PRVALBOL-OK             TO TRUE.
      *
           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC            TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE WS-PRPARAM                 TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.
           MOVE CON-PRDESC                 TO SWPARAM-PRDESC.
           MOVE CON-BOOLEAN                TO SWPARAM-PRTIPPAR.
           MOVE WS-FIRST-DATE              TO SWPARAM-PRVALDAT.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWPARAM-PRVALNUM.
           MOVE SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS         TO SWPARAM-PRVALBOL.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWPARAM-PRVALALF.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWPARAM-CUSERID.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              INSERT
                INTO SWPARAM (
                     PRCODPAR
                   , PRPARAM
                   , PRDESC
                   , PRTIPPAR
                   , PRVALDAT
                   , PRVALNUM
                   , PRVALBOL
                   , PRVALALF
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEEST
                )
              VALUES (
                     :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                   , :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
                   , :SWPARAM-PRDESC
                   , :SWPARAM-PRTIPPAR
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALNUM
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALBOL
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALALF
                   , :SWPARAM-CUSERID
                   , CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                )
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro INSERT'        TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       7299-CRIAR-PARAM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       7300-ACTUALIZA-PARAM.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '7300-ACTUALIZA-PARAM'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE WS-FIRST-DATE              TO SWPARAM-PRVALDAT.
           IF WS-NEW-DATE NOT EQUAL ZEROES
              MOVE WS-NEW-DATE             TO SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
           END-IF.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWPARAM-CUSERID.
           MOVE WS-PRVALALF                TO SWPARAM-PRVALALF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWPARAM
                 SET PRVALDAT  =  :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
                   , PRVALALF  =  :SWPARAM-PRVALALF
                   , CUSERID   =  :SWPARAM-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEEST  =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE PRCODPAR  =  :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                 AND PRPARAM   =  :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro UPDATE'        TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       7399-ACTUALIZA-PARAM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *    EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP9999 END-EXEC
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE AQCP0002 END-EXEC
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY VIAP0030.
           COPY AQCP0011.
           COPY AQCP0109.
           COPY AQCP0009.
           COPY SXCP1000.
           COPY ETCP9221.
      ******************************************************************
